<title>UK: Media Business wins CWC contract.</title>
<headline>Media Business wins CWC contract.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Media Business Group, one of the UK's leading media independants, on Wednesday announced it has been awarded a new media buying contract for Cable &amp; Wireless Communications (CWC).</p>
<p>Media will launch CWC's new corporate brand to consumers and business customers in the UK. The contract is expected to gross approximately 50 million stg for Media.</p>
<p>CWC was formed last year by merging Cable and Wireless Plc's Mercury unit with three cable television companies -- NYNEX CableComms Group, Bell Cablemedia Plc and Videotron.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
